#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:2
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Plugins"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| is extendable with custom plugins for Task types, UI tabs, "
"reports, approvals, cypher, and more. Plugins are added from the Plugins tab"
" of the Integration page under Administration (|AdmIntPlu|). Simply browse "
"for a local plugin file (.jar) to add it to the UI. Custom plugins can also "
"be edited or deleted by clicking on the pencil or trash can icons in the "
"corresponding row."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| es extendable con personalizado plugins para Tarea tipos, UI "
"tabs, reports, approvals, cypher, y más. Plugins son agregado desde el "
"Plugins pestaña de el Integración página under Administración (|AdmIntPlu|)."
" Simply browse para a local plugin file (.jar) a agregar ello a el UI. "
"Personalizado plugins puede también be edited o deleted por clicking en el "
"pencil o trash puede icons en el corresponding row."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| maintains a repository of internally-developed and vetted plugins"
" at |morpheus| `Exchange <https://share.morpheusdata.com/>`_. These plugins "
"can be downloaded and added to |morpheus| using the instructions in the "
"prior paragraph. Alongside the download link, you can also find helpful "
"readme information that discusses how the plugin can be used and which "
"versions of |morpheus| it's compatible with."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| maintains a repository de internally-developed y vetted plugins "
"en |morpheus| `Exchange <https://share.morpheusdata.com/>`_. Estos plugins "
"puede ser downloaded y agregado a |morpheus| usando el instructions en el "
"prior paragraph. Alongside el download link, usted puede también find "
"helpful readme information ese discusses how el plugin puede ser usado y que"
" versions de |morpheus| ello's compatible con."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:11
msgid ""
"With at least one plugin integrated, |morpheus| will show details on each "
"plugin from the Plugins List View. The following information is displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Con en least uno plugin integrated, |morpheus| va a show detalles en cada "
"plugin desde el Plugins Lista View. Lo siguiente information es mostrado:"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:13
msgid "**NAME:** The name given to the plugin"
msgstr "**NAME:** El nombre given a el plugin"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:14
msgid "**DESCRIPTION:** A description value (if any) coded into the plugin"
msgstr ""
"**DESCRIPTION:** Un description valor (si cualquier) coded en el plugin"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:15
msgid "**FILE NAME:** The .jar filename"
msgstr "**FILE NAME:** El .jar filename"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:16
msgid "**VERSION:** The plugin version number"
msgstr "**VERSION:** El plugin version número"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:17
msgid ""
"**STATUS:** The status of the plugin, such as \"loaded\" when the plugin is "
"ready for use"
msgstr ""
"**STATUS:** El status de el plugin, como \"loaded\" cuando el plugin es "
"ready para usar"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:18
msgid "**STATUS MESSAGE:** A status message (if any) for the plugin"
msgstr "**STATUS MESSAGE:** Un status message (si cualquier) para el plugin"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:19
msgid ""
"**ENABLED:** If the plugin is enabled, a check mark appears here. Disabled "
"plugins are also grayed out"
msgstr ""
"**ENABLED:** Si el plugin está habilitado, a check mark appears here. "
"Deshabilitado plugins son también grayed out"

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:21
msgid ""
"Additional information about each plugin can be viewed by clicking on the "
"pencil (edit) icon. Most of the information in this modal is read-only but "
"you can enable or disable plugins from this pane."
msgstr ""
"Additional information acerca de cada plugin puede ser viewed por clicking "
"en el pencil (editar) icon. La mayoría de de el information en este modal es"
" read-solo pero usted puede enable o disable plugins desde este pane."

#: ../../administration/integrations/plugins.rst:23
msgid ""
"Please visit the `Morpheus Developer Portal "
"<https://developer.morpheusdata.com>`_ for Plugin Architecture SDK "
"documentation and help getting started with custom Plugin development."
msgstr ""
"Please visit el `Morpheus Desarrollador Portal "
"<https://desarrollador.morpheusdata.com>`_ para Plugin Architecture SDK "
"documentation y help getting started con personalizado Plugin development."

